BCC_Q({"lv": "910", "y": 2021, "n": 6, "part": "B", "topic": "algo", "title": "Taxi", "answer": 1, "story": "<p>A taxi travels from the train station <img alt=\"\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:25px\"/> to the airport <img alt=\"\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:30px\"/> along the city streets shown in the map below. At each\nintersection, the taxi travels one block in the direction indicated by\nthe symbol at that intersection.<\/p>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<p><img alt=\"A description of the map follows.\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:60.0%\"/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<button onclick=\"hideSeek('longdesc3')\" style=\"box-shadow:none\">Hide/Reveal Description of Taxi Map<\/button>\n<div id=\"longdesc3\" style=\"display:none\">\n<p>Four roads travelling east-west (horizontal on the map) and five roads travelling north-south (vertical on the map) form a four by five grid of intersections.<\/p>\n<p>The train station is located at the south end of the second north-south (vertical) road. The taxi is at the train station and is facing north. The taxi is about to enter the southernmost intersection of the second north-south road.<\/p>\n<p>The airport is located at the north end of the fifth north-south road.<\/p>\n<p>Each intersection is marked with one of three symbols: a green circle, a yellow diamond, or a blue square. The shape marking each intersection in the four by five grid of intersections is given in the following four by five table.\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td>Circle<\/td>\n<td>Square<\/td>\n<td>Diamond<\/td>\n<td>Circle<\/td>\n<td>Square<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Square<\/td>\n<td>Diamond<\/td>\n<td>Circle<\/td>\n<td>Diamond<\/td>\n<td>Diamond<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Square<\/td>\n<td>Diamond<\/td>\n<td>Square<\/td>\n<td>Circle<\/td>\n<td>Square<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Diamond<\/td>\n<td>Circle<\/td>\n<td>Square<\/td>\n<td>Diamond<\/td>\n<td>Circle<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table>\n<p>For example, since the cell in row 4, column 2 (i.e. bottom row, second cell from the left) has the entry \"Circle\", the intersection the taxi is about to enter is marked with a green circle.<\/p>\n<hr class=\"longdesc\"/>\n<\/p><\/div>", "question": "<p>Which of the following gives the correct instruction for each\nsymbol?<\/p>\n<ol class=\"mc\">\n<li><table>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Symbol<\/th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Instruction<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"circle \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">continue in the same direction<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"diamond \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">turn the taxi to the driver’s left<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"square \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">turn the taxi to the driver’s right<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table><\/li>\n<li><table>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Symbol<\/th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Instruction<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"circle \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">continue in the same direction<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"diamond \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">turn the taxi to the driver’s right<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"square \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">turn the taxi to the driver’s left<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table><\/li>\n<li><table>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Symbol<\/th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Instruction<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"circle \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">turn the taxi to the driver’s right<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"diamond \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">turn the taxi to the driver’s left<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"square \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">continue in the same direction<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table><\/li>\n<li><table>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Symbol<\/th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Instruction<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"circle \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">turn the taxi to the driver’s left<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"diamond \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">turn the taxi to the driver’s right<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><img alt=\"square \" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">continue in the same direction<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table><\/li>\n<\/ol>", "answerHtml": "<p>(B) <\/p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Symbol<\/th>\n<th scope=\"col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Instruction<\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Circle\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">continue in the same direction<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"even\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Diamond\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">turn the taxi to the driver’s right<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"odd\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><img alt=\"Square\" class=\"static\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:20.0%\"/><\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">turn the taxi to the driver’s left<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/table>", "explanation": "<p>The taxi’s route corresponding to each of the four options is shown\nbelow. Option B gets the taxi from the train station to the airport.<\/p>\n<figure>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<figcaption>Option A<\/figcaption>\n<img alt=\"The taxi starts in row 4 column 2 (circle), then moves up to row 3 column 2 (diamond), left to row 3 column 1 (square), up to row 2 column 1 (square), right to row 2 column 2 (diamond), up to row 1 column 2 (square), right to row 1 column 3 (diamond), then up exiting the map. The taxi does not reach the airport.\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50.0%\"/>\n<\/div>\n<\/figure>\n<figure>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<figcaption>Option B<\/figcaption>\n<img alt=\"The taxi starts in row 4 column 2 (circle), then moves up to row 3 column 2 (diamond), right to row 3 column 3 (square), up to row 2 column 3 (circle), up again to row 1 column 3 (diamond), right to row 1 column 4 (circle), right again to row 1 column 5 (square), then up to the airport.\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50.0%\"/>\n<\/div>\n<\/figure>\n<figure>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<figcaption>Option C<\/figcaption>\n<img alt=\"The taxi starts in row 4 column 2 (circle), then moves right to row 4 column 3 (square), right to row 4 column 4 (diamond), up to row 3 column 4 (circle), right to row 3 column 5, then right exiting the map. This does not reach the airport.\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50.0%\"/>\n<\/div>\n<\/figure>\n<figure>\n<div class=\"center\">\n<figcaption>Option D<\/figcaption><p><img alt=\"The taxi starts in row 4 column 2 (circle), then moves left to row 4 column 1 (diamond), up to row 3 column 1 (square), up to row 2 column 1 (square), up to row 1 column 1 (circle), then left exiting the map. This does not reach the airport.\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:50.0%\"/>\n<\/p><\/div>\n<\/figure>", "connections": "<p>This task is primarily concerned with <span><em>tracing an\nalgorithm<\/em><\/span>. Specifically, each configuration of symbols\ncorresponds to a different <span><em>sequence of\ninstructions<\/em><\/span>. The key idea is to <span><em>trace<\/em><\/span>\nthe algorithm: at each intersection, determine whether the taxi turns\nright, left, or continues going straight. In order to assist with the\ntracing of the algorithm, we need to keep track of the direction of the\ntaxi as it comes into the intersection: this can be viewed as the\n<span><em>state<\/em><\/span> that is changing in this algorithm.<\/p>\n<p>Computer programmers use tracing to find errors in their programs,\nwhich is called <span><em>debugging<\/em><\/span>, or to\n<span><em>verify<\/em><\/span> that their code is correct.<\/p>"});